      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fair_Grove%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Boegel & Hine Flour Mill, later called Wommack Mill, was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1986.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fair_Grove%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The two‑day event still includes a parade and a church service in front of the historic mill.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fair_Grove%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Fair Grove Historical and Preservation Society, founded in the 1970s, restored the grist mill at the town’s center.",
